  "rules": [
    "Each ship may equip a standard shield and one optional Reserve Capacitor. Selecting the empty socket removes both.",
    "A shield hit that drains the first bank adds 100 points exactly once per duel. Excess damage consumes the new bank, then armor and hull.",
    "Bypassing rounds do not use either bank. A destroyed hull is never revived. Replay rearms the equipment."
  ],
  "fitting_checks": [
    "Physical clicks on the projected models and hull ports. All three armor finishes match the actual ship geometry and materials.",
    "Defense selection hides the weapon gallery. Shield, optional capacitor, removal, cancel, start, replay and independent equipment on both ships.",
    "Natural fire at 1x and 8x, with the starting shield set to one cannon hit. Checked 100 charge, active HUD, spent cell, second depletion and hull damage.",
    "Headless exact depletion, overflow, both banks breached by one hit, two impacts in one step, independent sides, bypass, absent shield and stock shield."
  ],
